#: projects/templates/projects/project_form.html:10
msgid ""
"Describe something concrete you want to realise with help from the gift "
"network, and list what you need for it. Keep it short and current: projects "
"nobody updates are archived after a while."
msgstr ""
"Beschreib etwas Konkretes, das ihr mit Hilfe aus dem Schenknetzwerk umsetzen "
